[statement]
Names packages only provide wait until every requested name has been
walked: `app1` requires `v` before `app2` is reached, yet `kw`, which
`app2` needs and which provides `v`, answers it, and `gk` is not installed.

[repository]
P:app1
V:1
D:v

P:app2
V:1
D:kw

P:kw
V:1
p:v

P:gk
V:1
p:v
k:100

[request]
app1
app2

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install kw 1
install app1 1
install app2 1
